# Configuration Files
config.json
gui_config.json

# Crash reports written by the program when something goes unhandled (the CRASH
# REPORTING section of the .pyw). The log is written beside the program, so running
# the .pyw from source leaves one in "GUI Source Code"; the installed program leaves
# its own beside the exe under %LOCALAPPDATA%\Programs\yt-msd.
yt-msd-crash.log
*.log

# Ignore test directories / generic folders created
Test Songs/
CLI Version/
build/
GUI Version/
wheels/
.pex/
build_dir/
build_dir_gui/
ffmpeg_extracted/
dist/

# The refactor harness and everything inside it - the wave scripts, verify.py, and the
# approved_edits.txt baseline recorded with --record. Untracked deliberately: it is scaffolding for
# moving code around rather than part of the shipped program, and that baseline belongs to whichever
# machine ran the wave, so a clone regenerates it rather than inheriting it.
# Both spellings are listed because ignore patterns are matched case-sensitively, and the harness
# folder has been referred to (and re-created) as either .test_harness or .Test_Harness.
.test_harness/
.Test_Harness/

# The GUI regression suite is tracked - every refactor wave is checked against it, so the
# checks themselves have to be part of the repo. Its throwaway import copies and the glyph
# sheet it paints are build residue, not tests.
GUI Source Code/GUI Test Suite/copy/
GUI Source Code/GUI Test Suite/captions.png

# Python artifacts
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.bak

# Executables
*.exe
*.pex

# PyInstaller one-folder build output: the GUI exe plus the _internal folder it needs
GUI Source Code/yt-msd-gui/

# Python build residues
*.spec
ffmpeg.zip

# Test Files
*.json

# The recorded sync-protocol session is the exception, and on purpose. It is not a file a suite
# generates and throws away: it is the frame-by-frame record of a whole client session that a phone
# client is written against and compared with, so it has to be part of the repo and reviewed when it
# changes, like the checks that read it.
!GUI Source Code/GUI Test Suite/fixtures/protocol/*.json

# Cython build artifacts (generated C sources, compiled extensions, cythonize staging dir)
build_dir_cython/
*.pyd
GUI Source Code/*.c
CLI Source Code/*.c

# Personal AI reference notes - notes written FOR the AI assistant, never shipped with the repo.
# Deliberately untracked: it is not documentation for users and must never be committed.
AI Readme.md
GUI Source Code/AI Readme.md